= Heading level one =
== Inventory service ==
The '''inventory service''' keeps stock levels for every ''warehouse'' and answers reorder questions.
It can be '''''bold italic''''', <b>HTML bold</b>, <i>HTML italic</i>, <u>underlined</u>,
<s>struck</s>, <del>deleted</del>, <ins>inserted</ins>, H<sub>2</sub>O and x<sup>2</sup>.

